(489284, 46806, 4493, '<td valign="top">Over contrast and sharpened. I''m sure you were going for the newspaper feel, but I feel it''s distracting. Overall concept and composition do not grab me. 5 -danny</td>', 'Over contrast and sharpened. I''m sure you were going for the newspaper feel, but I feel it''s distracting. Overall concept and composition do not grab me. 5 -danny', '2003-11-19 00:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
