(489705, 47694, 14094, '<td valign="top">The message is clear: line up to buy Coca-Cola.  Technically, we have a lot of grain and motion blur, but the target audience is also clear.  Not bad.</td>', 'The message is clear: line up to buy Coca-Cola.  Technically, we have a lot of grain and motion blur, but the target audience is also clear.  Not bad.', '2003-11-19 08:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(489707, 46831, 14094, '<td valign="top">Follow what...the tree?  I think the path is the appropriate metaphor here, but it is unfortunately cropped on the left.  Now, with the trees in front of the church, it is difficult to ascertain the subject.  How about a shallow fisheye shot from the base of the tower looking up?  That would be much better.</td>', 'Follow what...the tree?  I think the path is the appropriate metaphor here, but it is unfortunately cropped on the left.  Now, with the trees in front of the church, it is difficult to ascertain the subject.  How about a shallow fisheye shot from the base of the tower looking up?  That would be much better.', '2003-11-19 08:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(489708, 47460, 14094, '<td valign="top">Composition is average here.  The signs are the obvious subject, but wise choices are not apparent (neither is the opposite).  The message is not presented very well here.</td>', 'Composition is average here.  The signs are the obvious subject, but wise choices are not apparent (neither is the opposite).  The message is not presented very well here.', '2003-11-19 08:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(489712, 46835, 14094, '<td valign="top">Now cometh real propoganda.  The subject is quite obvious, even without the title, so kudos to the artist on that point.  I cannot rate this a 10 because of a few technicalities with the composition.  However, the message and picture are presented excellently.</td>', 'Now cometh real propoganda.  The subject is quite obvious, even without the title, so kudos to the artist on that point.  I cannot rate this a 10 because of a few technicalities with the composition.  However, the message and picture are presented excellently.', '2003-11-19 08:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
