(489715, 47607, 14094, '<td valign="top">Just what does this underexposed, ill-framed shot of a guitar have to do with money swearing?  What is meant by "propoganda all is phony"?  This would be better suited as a tribute to Jerry Garcia or something like that.</td>', 'Just what does this underexposed, ill-framed shot of a guitar have to do with money swearing?  What is meant by "propoganda all is phony"?  This would be better suited as a tribute to Jerry Garcia or something like that.', '2003-11-19 08:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
