(489751, 47375, 4493, '<td valign="top">I can somewhat see what you are going for here. I think your presentation would be helped by a square crop so as to cut out the unneeded negative space on the left. 5 -danny</td>', 'I can somewhat see what you are going for here. I think your presentation would be helped by a square crop so as to cut out the unneeded negative space on the left. 5 -danny', '2003-11-19 09:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
