(489831, 47604, 13381, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea.  I love the big, looming shadow behind the action figure.  I love that he "comes in peace" but carries a huge gun.  I don''t love that his label is stuck above his head.  I think the irony of the photo (and the action figure) is made clear by the label, but I''d rather see it in a less obtrusive place.</td>', 'I really like this idea.  I love the big, looming shadow behind the action figure.  I love that he "comes in peace" but carries a huge gun.  I don''t love that his label is stuck above his head.  I think the irony of the photo (and the action figure) is made clear by the label, but I''d rather see it in a less obtrusive place.', '2003-11-19 10:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
