(490644, 47335, 7151, '<td valign="top">I have the feeling there''s something left out message wise - maybe some local issue?  The photo''s ok - better than a straight on shot, but not real striking.  I think I''d like it better to see more of the little schoolhous structure - would help the schoolhouse symoblism to be more striking.</td>', 'I have the feeling there''s something left out message wise - maybe some local issue?  The photo''s ok - better than a straight on shot, but not real striking.  I think I''d like it better to see more of the little schoolhous structure - would help the schoolhouse symoblism to be more striking.', '2003-11-20 00:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(490647, 47548, 7151, '<td valign="top">Carrying the "reflection" at least a couple, if not a few, levels deeper would have been more appealing - as it is, it just leaves me asking why.  And the wood grain in the printed shot is kind of a detraction.  Quality is just alright.  <br/> <br/>5.  ...no... 10 ...no... 6 ...no... 10 ...no... 4 ...no... 10 ...no...</td>', 'Carrying the "reflection" at least a couple, if not a few, levels deeper would have been more appealing - as it is, it just leaves me asking why.  And the wood grain in the printed shot is kind of a detraction.  Quality is just alright.   5.  ...no... 10 ...no... 6 ...no... 10 ...no... 4 ...no... 10 ...no...', '2003-11-20 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(490654, 47699, 7151, '<td valign="top">This coulda worked but for two things:  the eyes need to be looking into the camera, and the title needs to be more subtle - "resistance is futile" is just campy.  Fix those and maybe bump up the contrast a bit, and you might have had a really striking entry.</td>', 'This coulda worked but for two things:  the eyes need to be looking into the camera, and the title needs to be more subtle - "resistance is futile" is just campy.  Fix those and maybe bump up the contrast a bit, and you might have had a really striking entry.', '2003-11-20 00:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(490658, 46852, 4967, '<td valign="top">Being ruined by a nasty cigarette?  I''m not sure what your propaganda is going for... I like the photo, but am completely turned off by the cigarette.</td>', 'Being ruined by a nasty cigarette?  I''m not sure what your propaganda is going for... I like the photo, but am completely turned off by the cigarette.', '2003-11-20 01:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(490663, 47407, 9809, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out what I''m looking at.</td>', 'I can''t figure out what I''m looking at.', '2003-11-20 01:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(490664, 47408, 10263, '<td valign="top">Not only did this make me laugh out loud, it is a gorgeous photo. Focus is wonderful. The orange in the beak and around the eye is striking. i LOVE that it is outside the box :) 10</td>', 'Not only did this make me laugh out loud, it is a gorgeous photo. Focus is wonderful. The orange in the beak and around the eye is striking. i LOVE that it is outside the box :) 10', '2003-11-20 01:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(490666, 46917, 10263, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo but there must be something I''m not seeing? Where is the patriotism?</td>', 'Interesting photo but there must be something I''m not seeing? Where is the patriotism?', '2003-11-20 01:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(490669, 47709, 10263, '<td valign="top">Certainly a lot of WOW in this one. Fits the topic perfectly and the colors are beautiful. Composition is wonderful as well</td>', 'Certainly a lot of WOW in this one. Fits the topic perfectly and the colors are beautiful. Composition is wonderful as well', '2003-11-20 02:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(490670, 47478, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is great. One of the few submissions that are dead on (pun intended lol) as far as fitting the subject. The smoke is a nice touch.</td>', 'This is great. One of the few submissions that are dead on (pun intended lol) as far as fitting the subject. The smoke is a nice touch.', '2003-11-20 02:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(490682, 47223, 10170, '<td valign="top">Portrays an awful feeling very effectively.  Good shot.</td>', 'Portrays an awful feeling very effectively.  Good shot.', '2003-11-20 03:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(490683, 47597, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea and beautifully executed.</td>', 'Very clever idea and beautifully executed.', '2003-11-20 03:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(490686, 46806, 10170, '<td valign="top">The title makes this otherwise unfortunate situation rather amusing.  Nice pic, got a sort of newspaper feel to it.</td>', 'The title makes this otherwise unfortunate situation rather amusing.  Nice pic, got a sort of newspaper feel to it.', '2003-11-20 03:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(490687, 47415, 10170, '<td valign="top">Great composition, the b&amp;w works well.  Might have been better with a smaller border, but not enough to matter.</td>', 'Great composition, the b&w works well.  Might have been better with a smaller border, but not enough to matter.', '2003-11-20 03:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(490688, 47717, 10170, '<td valign="top">Oh, the look on that face!  Lovely photo, good use of tones, the bars work very wel indeed.</td>', 'Oh, the look on that face!  Lovely photo, good use of tones, the bars work very wel indeed.', '2003-11-20 03:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(490689, 47596, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very well done indeed.  The b&amp;w and grain gives this impact.  Nice makeup job as well.</td>', 'Very well done indeed.  The b&w and grain gives this impact.  Nice makeup job as well.', '2003-11-20 03:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(490690, 47322, 10170, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  A little more light on the cross maybe, but a minor critism.</td>', 'Nice work.  A little more light on the cross maybe, but a minor critism.', '2003-11-20 03:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(490691, 47138, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very amusing :)  Nicely taken shot as well.</td>', 'Very amusing :)  Nicely taken shot as well.', '2003-11-20 03:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(490692, 47543, 10170, '<td valign="top">Maybe Mudwig is a twat *laugh*  Nicely done, good use of b&amp;w.</td>', 'Maybe Mudwig is a twat *laugh*  Nicely done, good use of b&w.', '2003-11-20 03:49:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(490694, 47443, 10170, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Would have been better if the spires had been complete, maybe some space above them even (maybe not an option though where it was taken).</td>', 'I like it.  Would have been better if the spires had been complete, maybe some space above them even (maybe not an option though where it was taken).', '2003-11-20 03:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(490695, 47604, 10170, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good use of the shadow.</td>', 'Nice composition, good use of the shadow.', '2003-11-20 03:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(490696, 47285, 10170, '<td valign="top">Great portrayal of progaganda, best in terms of message yet (i''m maybe 75% through).  Nice work.</td>', 'Great portrayal of progaganda, best in terms of message yet (i''m maybe 75% through).  Nice work.', '2003-11-20 03:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(490697, 47529, 10170, '<td valign="top">Excellent, both in terms of meeting the challenge and photo in general.</td>', 'Excellent, both in terms of meeting the challenge and photo in general.', '2003-11-20 03:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(490699, 47610, 10170, '<td valign="top">Love it.  As the pic started to show on my screen I thought it was going to be too dark, then I saw the effect with the light on the face, and it works perfectly.  Great shot, hopefully in line for a ribbon.</td>', 'Love it.  As the pic started to show on my screen I thought it was going to be too dark, then I saw the effect with the light on the face, and it works perfectly.  Great shot, hopefully in line for a ribbon.', '2003-11-20 03:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(490700, 47433, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very clever and nicely taken.</td>', 'Very clever and nicely taken.', '2003-11-20 03:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(490709, 47478, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one is dreadfully effective! I love the composition and the smoke, I would be happy to see this one in the top 3, so good luck, go on! :-) Take 10 from me.</td>', 'Wow, this one is dreadfully effective! I love the composition and the smoke, I would be happy to see this one in the top 3, so good luck, go on! :-) Take 10 from me.', '2003-11-20 04:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(490713, 47504, 10170, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting, and nice and strong propaganda wise.  A minor critism is that I would have preferred the DOF to be either substantially more Or less, so the far dummy was far mor eout of focus, or crisper, but that is a very minor critism.  Great work.</td>', 'Love the lighting, and nice and strong propaganda wise.  A minor critism is that I would have preferred the DOF to be either substantially more Or less, so the far dummy was far mor eout of focus, or crisper, but that is a very minor critism.  Great work.', '2003-11-20 05:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(490714, 47598, 10170, '<td valign="top">Wow!  The hardest hitting one I''ve yet seem (maybe 80% through them).  Well done.</td>', 'Wow!  The hardest hitting one I''ve yet seem (maybe 80% through them).  Well done.', '2003-11-20 05:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(490715, 46852, 10170, '<td valign="top">Love it.  The lighting and dead black space make this quite stunning.</td>', 'Love it.  The lighting and dead black space make this quite stunning.', '2003-11-20 05:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(490716, 47522, 10170, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo but I don''t get the propaganda angle.  The title says magnificence, and the photo looks that way.  I can''t see what the propaganda message here is (private message me if you want to explain, maybe it is me being stupid and missing the obvious).</td>', 'Lovely photo but I don''t get the propaganda angle.  The title says magnificence, and the photo looks that way.  I can''t see what the propaganda message here is (private message me if you want to explain, maybe it is me being stupid and missing the obvious).', '2003-11-20 05:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(490717, 47545, 10170, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo.  Don''t get the propaganda message here, but will happily put that down to me being from another part of the world.</td>', 'Stunning photo.  Don''t get the propaganda message here, but will happily put that down to me being from another part of the world.', '2003-11-20 05:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(490718, 47526, 10170, '<td valign="top">*laugh*  Love it, my favourite shot of the challenge.</td>', '*laugh*  Love it, my favourite shot of the challenge.', '2003-11-20 05:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(490719, 47335, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very well framed. I also love the contrast between the bland building and the red one.</td>', 'Very well framed. I also love the contrast between the bland building and the red one.', '2003-11-20 05:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(490720, 47147, 10170, '<td valign="top">Hard hitting photo.  Very well done indeed.</td>', 'Hard hitting photo.  Very well done indeed.', '2003-11-20 05:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
