(490724, 47718, 10170, '<td valign="top">Oh, I just can''t wait to see who did this one *laugh*  Excellent, cracked me up.  Mind you, you could have written the "Kiwi sucks" part in bigger letters ;p *laugh*</td>', 'Oh, I just can''t wait to see who did this one *laugh*  Excellent, cracked me up.  Mind you, you could have written the "Kiwi sucks" part in bigger letters ;p *laugh*', '2003-11-20 05:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
