(490741, 47099, 10170, '<td valign="top">Like it.  Very realistic feeling to this.  My only (small) negative would be that it might have been even better in front of a stone/brick wall, but maybe only as I have a picture of a firing squad in my head.</td>', 'Like it.  Very realistic feeling to this.  My only (small) negative would be that it might have been even better in front of a stone/brick wall, but maybe only as I have a picture of a firing squad in my head.', '2003-11-20 05:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
