(490744, 47248, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, and a good entry for the challenge topic.  Little more care with the tattoo might have made it look more real, but that is a very minor point.</td>', 'Very nicely done, and a good entry for the challenge topic.  Little more care with the tattoo might have made it look more real, but that is a very minor point.', '2003-11-20 05:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
