(490792, 47723, 6624, '<td valign="top">This is my pick of the challenge.  The light, the subject matter, the fact that propaganda can assume such a dignified and inviting stance are all wonderfuul. The loss of the black in the background to the right is too bad but as it picks up her hair tones it works. This has an understated elegance that gets my vote 10</td>', 'This is my pick of the challenge.  The light, the subject matter, the fact that propaganda can assume such a dignified and inviting stance are all wonderfuul. The loss of the black in the background to the right is too bad but as it picks up her hair tones it works. This has an understated elegance that gets my vote 10', '2003-11-20 08:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(490797, 47285, 6624, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting image and fits the challenge with its title (which could be tightened a bit and maybe applied to the image later on)  color, good, lighting very nice, I like the fringed backlighting, curveof the zipper and collar are nice 9</td>', 'This is a very interesting image and fits the challenge with its title (which could be tightened a bit and maybe applied to the image later on)  color, good, lighting very nice, I like the fringed backlighting, curveof the zipper and collar are nice 9', '2003-11-20 08:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(490799, 47478, 6624, '<td valign="top">I have seen many anti-smoking propagandistic posters and ads...you have a best-seller here.  Excellent title (which could be applied to the image and then sold in a minute I would bet.  well composed, lit, good focus...good job 10</td>', 'I have seen many anti-smoking propagandistic posters and ads...you have a best-seller here.  Excellent title (which could be applied to the image and then sold in a minute I would bet.  well composed, lit, good focus...good job 10', '2003-11-20 08:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(490800, 47717, 6624, '<td valign="top">I understand the difficult of getting the dog to pose where you could get the features but I do wish the angle had been more level.  Other than that it''s a good response to the challenge</td>', 'I understand the difficult of getting the dog to pose where you could get the features but I do wish the angle had been more level.  Other than that it''s a good response to the challenge', '2003-11-20 08:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
