(490810, 47714, 6624, '<td valign="top">Right in the spirit of propaganda posters of my youth, and I love the title.  There\''s a book by a woman named Honor Tracy which has as its epigraph something about the effort to tread the thin line \"between right or wrong\". Well composed, balanced, good light, focus, I would almost have liked to see the title text in the image - perhaps instead of the spirit of America message especiaslly because the k spelling in the title works well</td>', 'Right in the spirit of propaganda posters of my youth, and I love the title.  There\''s a book by a woman named Honor Tracy which has as its epigraph something about the effort to tread the thin line \"between right or wrong\". Well composed, balanced, good light, focus, I would almost have liked to see the title text in the image - perhaps instead of the spirit of America message especiaslly because the k spelling in the title works well', '2003-11-20 08:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(490811, 47708, 6624, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent example of propaganda - there will be objections to the hot spot on the duck tape but it is a minimal problem.  Fits the challenge, good focus, composition, original, perhaps a little too dark on the left</td>', 'This is an excellent example of propaganda - there will be objections to the hot spot on the duck tape but it is a minimal problem.  Fits the challenge, good focus, composition, original, perhaps a little too dark on the left', '2003-11-20 08:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
