(490900, 47616, 3569, '<td valign="top">I like the focal point being on the drug and face in back.  Great shot.</td>', 'I like the focal point being on the drug and face in back.  Great shot.', '2003-11-20 09:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(490907, 47593, 3295, '<td valign="top">Strong photo, I wonder if you could have rotated a little bit more to avoid the street sign.</td>', 'Strong photo, I wonder if you could have rotated a little bit more to avoid the street sign.', '2003-11-20 10:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(490910, 47694, 3295, '<td valign="top">not sure this is propaganda, and not commercialization.  I like the blur, the look and the photo.</td>', 'not sure this is propaganda, and not commercialization.  I like the blur, the look and the photo.', '2003-11-20 10:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(490911, 47722, 3295, '<td valign="top">mmm...  I like it, would have liked the jar highlighed a little more.</td>', 'mmm...  I like it, would have liked the jar highlighed a little more.', '2003-11-20 10:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(490921, 47616, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of shock tactics. Because of the patients own narrow focus on the contents of the syringe everything else, including his health, is rubbed out - I think the DOF choice really shows that.</td>', 'Great use of shock tactics. Because of the patients own narrow focus on the contents of the syringe everything else, including his health, is rubbed out - I think the DOF choice really shows that.', '2003-11-20 10:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(490925, 47692, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not quiet clear on the message being conveyed. Is it that Liberty is there for the taking? Or that the concept of Liberty in the US is wooden? I''m just not sure I''m getting the right idea. That said I like the image, the dark shadows of the model and the bright light on the coin against that darkness. Low DOF is well used. I''d like a touch more space at the bottom so that the space between coin and lower edge of frame is same as space between coin and right edge of frame.</td>', 'I''m not quiet clear on the message being conveyed. Is it that Liberty is there for the taking? Or that the concept of Liberty in the US is wooden? I''m just not sure I''m getting the right idea. That said I like the image, the dark shadows of the model and the bright light on the coin against that darkness. Low DOF is well used. I''d like a touch more space at the bottom so that the space between coin and lower edge of frame is same as space between coin and right edge of frame.', '2003-11-20 10:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(490927, 47434, 3087, '<td valign="top">Without the title I wouldn''t have really understood the message, though most propaganda images have supporting text, so I''m not saying that as a criticism. I like the composition, the close crop on the model works well. I also like the way she''s looking up a stairway of light - is that meant to represent the tunnel of light people are meant to see on death?</td>', 'Without the title I wouldn''t have really understood the message, though most propaganda images have supporting text, so I''m not saying that as a criticism. I like the composition, the close crop on the model works well. I also like the way she''s looking up a stairway of light - is that meant to represent the tunnel of light people are meant to see on death?', '2003-11-20 10:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(490928, 47711, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2003-11-20 10:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(490929, 47705, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting image though I''m not quite sure what it''s saying. Who speaks the truth, on what subject? <br/>I do like the image itself and the choices of B/W and limited DOF work well for me.<br/>I''d like to see the vertical line of the mike more accurately vertical within the frame.</td>', 'Interesting image though I''m not quite sure what it''s saying. Who speaks the truth, on what subject? I do like the image itself and the choices of B/W and limited DOF work well for me.I''d like to see the vertical line of the mike more accurately vertical within the frame.', '2003-11-20 10:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(490932, 47590, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this and it´s good.</td>', 'I like this and it´s good.', '2003-11-20 10:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(490934, 47462, 3087, '<td valign="top">At first I was about to dismiss this as someone else''s art - then I noticed the ghost figure.<br/>But I am afraid I don''t get the message - what does the presence/ position/ pose of the man imply?<br/>An intriguing image, certainly, but I''m obviously not getting the propagandist message?</td>', 'At first I was about to dismiss this as someone else''s art - then I noticed the ghost figure.But I am afraid I don''t get the message - what does the presence/ position/ pose of the man imply?An intriguing image, certainly, but I''m obviously not getting the propagandist message?', '2003-11-20 10:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(490937, 47543, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very strong image though I can''t say it''s hugely appealing. The composition just takes my breath away - the position of the pay meter and the lines of the fence, paving, building and windows just clicks for me.<br/>In terms of "message" this is speaking to me about the futility of this kind of graffiti - wanton destruction without even remote mitigation of scrawling a political message within the graffiti. <br/>What message, thought or concept were you aiming at conveying?</td>', 'I think this is a very strong image though I can''t say it''s hugely appealing. The composition just takes my breath away - the position of the pay meter and the lines of the fence, paving, building and windows just clicks for me.In terms of "message" this is speaking to me about the futility of this kind of graffiti - wanton destruction without even remote mitigation of scrawling a political message within the graffiti. What message, thought or concept were you aiming at conveying?', '2003-11-20 10:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(490939, 47711, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice image with great colours but what exactly is the message, thought or concept being conveyed here? Which men are these gingerbread biscuits representing in terms of the message?</td>', 'Nice image with great colours but what exactly is the message, thought or concept being conveyed here? Which men are these gingerbread biscuits representing in terms of the message?', '2003-11-20 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(490941, 47709, 3087, '<td valign="top">My knowledge of world politics is probably letting me down hugely here but I am assuming that the image is exploring the belief that this leader, as featured on the bank notes of his country, is motivated by financial concerns over the more real concerns of his country. Is that even remotely what the message of the poster is? If I''m right then I can certainly imagine it being used as a poster by any political party in opposition to him. Composition isn''t hugely strong - final image seems unbalanced by space at left but not at right.</td>', 'My knowledge of world politics is probably letting me down hugely here but I am assuming that the image is exploring the belief that this leader, as featured on the bank notes of his country, is motivated by financial concerns over the more real concerns of his country. Is that even remotely what the message of the poster is? If I''m right then I can certainly imagine it being used as a poster by any political party in opposition to him. Composition isn''t hugely strong - final image seems unbalanced by space at left but not at right.', '2003-11-20 10:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(490946, 47708, 3087, '<td valign="top">Now this is a strong propaganda message - one that can easily be understood without supporting text or effort. I won''t comment on whether I agree or disagree with the suggestion that the current political climate in the US discourages free speech and dissention but I will say that I think the photo conveys that suggestion very well.<br/>Lighting is not ideal with dark shadows at left. Model''s nose could have done with a powder to reduce that shine.</td>', 'Now this is a strong propaganda message - one that can easily be understood without supporting text or effort. I won''t comment on whether I agree or disagree with the suggestion that the current political climate in the US discourages free speech and dissention but I will say that I think the photo conveys that suggestion very well.Lighting is not ideal with dark shadows at left. Model''s nose could have done with a powder to reduce that shine.', '2003-11-20 10:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(490947, 47526, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting recreation of WW2 era propganda.</td>', 'Interesting recreation of WW2 era propganda.', '2003-11-20 10:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(490951, 46722, 3087, '<td valign="top">Message is strong. Image is weakened by lack of clarity in monitor image and I personally would prefer it without the monitor frame showing.</td>', 'Message is strong. Image is weakened by lack of clarity in monitor image and I personally would prefer it without the monitor frame showing.', '2003-11-20 10:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(490953, 47694, 3087, '<td valign="top">Has a very gritty feel and I like the motion blur of the first girl in the queue. Could do with more of the Coca-Cola logo in the frame.</td>', 'Has a very gritty feel and I like the motion blur of the first girl in the queue. Could do with more of the Coca-Cola logo in the frame.', '2003-11-20 10:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(490955, 47489, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is veeeery strange but ignoring the message (which I obviously don''t get) I really like the image. The combination of textures and colours is great and the final image is interesting and quirky.</td>', 'This is veeeery strange but ignoring the message (which I obviously don''t get) I really like the image. The combination of textures and colours is great and the final image is interesting and quirky.', '2003-11-20 10:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(490957, 47466, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this idea and the image is strong and clean but I''m missing something. Next to be broken/ attacked BY the USA or next to be attacked WITHIN the USA? I''m just not clear on what the message actually is.</td>', 'I like this idea and the image is strong and clean but I''m missing something. Next to be broken/ attacked BY the USA or next to be attacked WITHIN the USA? I''m just not clear on what the message actually is.', '2003-11-20 10:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(490958, 47541, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice use of texture and interesting light/ shadow.</td>', 'Good composition, nice use of texture and interesting light/ shadow.', '2003-11-20 10:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(490960, 47535, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming this refers to ad that goes "This is a frying pan. This is an egg. This is an egg in a frying pan. Drugs are like this, only different. Any questions?" - I only found about that by searching just now on Google. <br/> <br/>Unless one knows that advert this makes no sense at all. So it''s either a copy of someone else''s propaganda or a comment on that progaganda (which I''m not getting).</td>', 'I''m assuming this refers to ad that goes "This is a frying pan. This is an egg. This is an egg in a frying pan. Drugs are like this, only different. Any questions?" - I only found about that by searching just now on Google.  Unless one knows that advert this makes no sense at all. So it''s either a copy of someone else''s propaganda or a comment on that progaganda (which I''m not getting).', '2003-11-20 10:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(490961, 47465, 3087, '<td valign="top">A strong image with a nice abstract touch whilst retaining the recognition factor. To me the message is anti war - I''ll be interested to know what message was intended. The image quality seems a little grainy.</td>', 'A strong image with a nice abstract touch whilst retaining the recognition factor. To me the message is anti war - I''ll be interested to know what message was intended. The image quality seems a little grainy.', '2003-11-20 10:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(490963, 47478, 3087, '<td valign="top">Message clear to understand. Macabre way of showing message makes image somewhat fascinating - that woud guarantee attention should it be shown on a billboard or similar. Balance doesn''t quite work for me, too much empty space at right and not quite enough at left.</td>', 'Message clear to understand. Macabre way of showing message makes image somewhat fascinating - that woud guarantee attention should it be shown on a billboard or similar. Balance doesn''t quite work for me, too much empty space at right and not quite enough at left.', '2003-11-20 10:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(490965, 47407, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image with very strong composition and fascinating textures but I have absolutely no idea what it is and therefore what the message might be.</td>', 'A beautiful image with very strong composition and fascinating textures but I have absolutely no idea what it is and therefore what the message might be.', '2003-11-20 10:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(490971, 46848, 3087, '<td valign="top">If this is a turnaround of the suggestion that Rumsfeld is the Ace of Spades and Saddam the joker in the pack then I assume the idea of this is to represent the kind of propaganda his supporters might retaliate with?<br/> <br/></td>', 'If this is a turnaround of the suggestion that Rumsfeld is the Ace of Spades and Saddam the joker in the pack then I assume the idea of this is to represent the kind of propaganda his supporters might retaliate with? ', '2003-11-20 10:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
