(491480, 47436, 4493, '<td valign="top">OK, this has something to do with Pot... but, I''m not getting it. Sorry. You have one serious wide angle lens there though. 5 -danny</td>', 'OK, this has something to do with Pot... but, I''m not getting it. Sorry. You have one serious wide angle lens there though. 5 -danny', '2003-11-20 23:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
