(491482, 47610, 4493, '<td valign="top">Yikes, what are the odds of 2 similar images using light from the book? Both very well executed. I like the framing of your subject by the books, but I think there is too much negative space above her. 7 -danny</td>', 'Yikes, what are the odds of 2 similar images using light from the book? Both very well executed. I like the framing of your subject by the books, but I think there is too much negative space above her. 7 -danny', '2003-11-20 23:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(491483, 47701, 4493, '<td valign="top">If they''re all the same size, why do we have them cropped off on the sides? Show us a little more negative space around them. They seem very crowded in here. 5 -danny</td>', 'If they''re all the same size, why do we have them cropped off on the sides? Show us a little more negative space around them. They seem very crowded in here. 5 -danny', '2003-11-20 23:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(491484, 47611, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and execution. I would like to see a tighter crop to loose the CD on the left of the coin. Seems to through the balance off. 6 -danny</td>', 'Nice concept and execution. I would like to see a tighter crop to loose the CD on the left of the coin. Seems to through the balance off. 6 -danny', '2003-11-20 23:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(491485, 47621, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good tones. I think that perhaps having some pills or something in the shot too might bring your statement across better. Usually 2 objects in a photo leave it feeling unbalanced. So the inclussion of the third element and a possible different perspective would have bumped this up a few notches. 7 -danny</td>', 'Good tones. I think that perhaps having some pills or something in the shot too might bring your statement across better. Usually 2 objects in a photo leave it feeling unbalanced. So the inclussion of the third element and a possible different perspective would have bumped this up a few notches. 7 -danny', '2003-11-20 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(491486, 47395, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, how true.  Republicrat. :)  But a Republicrat is still better then a Demorat. :D  Very nice abstract with no distractions in it, just great colors.</td>', 'LOL, how true.  Republicrat. :)  But a Republicrat is still better then a Demorat. :D  Very nice abstract with no distractions in it, just great colors.', '2003-11-20 23:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(491487, 47729, 4493, '<td valign="top">For this type of shot to work, you need a straight on perspective. When the camera is off to the left like it is, your figurine will appear to slant to one side. If you''re wanting the back to be totally black, work on minimizing the wrinkles in it. That will help keep it from bouncing light off at weird angles. 5 -danny</td>', 'For this type of shot to work, you need a straight on perspective. When the camera is off to the left like it is, your figurine will appear to slant to one side. If you''re wanting the back to be totally black, work on minimizing the wrinkles in it. That will help keep it from bouncing light off at weird angles. 5 -danny', '2003-11-20 23:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(491488, 47434, 4493, '<td valign="top">Can''t really rate this one on techincal aspect, as I don''t believe that''s what you were going for. Your overall presentation and composition is good. The fact that the person is looking up the stairs adds to the pensive mood. I''m not sure I agree with your subject matter, but as far as story telling goes, you''ve done well. 8 -danny</td>', 'Can''t really rate this one on techincal aspect, as I don''t believe that''s what you were going for. Your overall presentation and composition is good. The fact that the person is looking up the stairs adds to the pensive mood. I''m not sure I agree with your subject matter, but as far as story telling goes, you''ve done well. 8 -danny', '2003-11-20 23:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(491489, 47400, 4494, '<td valign="top">Don''t see how this is propaganda.</td>', 'Don''t see how this is propaganda.', '2003-11-20 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(491490, 47699, 4493, '<td valign="top">When shooting, you need to always try to work within the camera''s  limits. It appears you may have been a little too close to the cat for the macro function. Your focus is soft and the sharpness of the hair is lost as a result. 5 -danny</td>', 'When shooting, you need to always try to work within the camera''s  limits. It appears you may have been a little too close to the cat for the macro function. Your focus is soft and the sharpness of the hair is lost as a result. 5 -danny', '2003-11-20 23:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
