(491584, 46819, 14043, '<td valign="top">It might have worked for the challenge if you had given a title that actually showed it as propoganda (it didn''t to me at least).  The one you used sounds more for a gallery than to represent propoganda.  Perhaps "The sky''s so crowded with civilization, have you forgotten the clouds?"  *shrugs* Something a bit more.<br/> <br/>I love the way you captured the various curves of the highways, but where are the clouds that the title talks about?</td>', 'It might have worked for the challenge if you had given a title that actually showed it as propoganda (it didn''t to me at least).  The one you used sounds more for a gallery than to represent propoganda.  Perhaps "The sky''s so crowded with civilization, have you forgotten the clouds?"  *shrugs* Something a bit more. I love the way you captured the various curves of the highways, but where are the clouds that the title talks about?', '2003-11-21 01:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
