(491733, 47504, 11785, '<td valign="top">why it remind me Hitler... may be it is joke? from where you are getting those wooden toys... bit out of focus... too many questions...</td>', 'why it remind me Hitler... may be it is joke? from where you are getting those wooden toys... bit out of focus... too many questions...', '2003-11-21 10:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(491759, 47701, 11693, '<td valign="top">Sorry,<br/> <br/>I took this as a slam on Scouting.  My Dad is and Eagle Scout, I was a life scout and my son is an Eagle Scout.  I took your photo wrong and am sorry.  I have been involved in Scouting off and on since 1962.  You are right Scouting needs the support.  My apology.  David A Paulissen, newtune3  10</td>', 'Sorry, I took this as a slam on Scouting.  My Dad is and Eagle Scout, I was a life scout and my son is an Eagle Scout.  I took your photo wrong and am sorry.  I have been involved in Scouting off and on since 1962.  You are right Scouting needs the support.  My apology.  David A Paulissen, newtune3  10', '2003-11-21 11:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(491760, 46851, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting to have it this dark - makes the "bald" head seem to hover in space.  Brings focus to the eye, themeatically.  Wish the feathers and beak were sharper.  The red color adds to the propaganda effect - angry eagle bent on revenge - watch out!  Wold be more powerful with a more dramatic composition - more blackness to the left and below for the eagle to be looking into planning to swoop down?</td>', 'Interesting to have it this dark - makes the "bald" head seem to hover in space.  Brings focus to the eye, themeatically.  Wish the feathers and beak were sharper.  The red color adds to the propaganda effect - angry eagle bent on revenge - watch out!  Wold be more powerful with a more dramatic composition - more blackness to the left and below for the eagle to be looking into planning to swoop down?', '2003-11-21 11:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(491761, 47400, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a lovely necklace.  The composition makes it very tempting - reaching out to the viewer.  The background swallows up the chain or ribbon - perhaps something that contrasted better.  The glare does make it seem to sparkle, but it is more distracting than helpful.</td>', 'What a lovely necklace.  The composition makes it very tempting - reaching out to the viewer.  The background swallows up the chain or ribbon - perhaps something that contrasted better.  The glare does make it seem to sparkle, but it is more distracting than helpful.', '2003-11-21 11:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(491762, 47474, 7628, '<td valign="top">A comment on the propaganda that surrounds us, constantly calling to us (or shouting!) I like the color and composition.  This swatch storefront seems like the bow of a ship setting sail in an ocean of advertising,  Wish the sky weren''t quite so bright.  I might crop the lamp on the right out.</td>', 'A comment on the propaganda that surrounds us, constantly calling to us (or shouting!) I like the color and composition.  This swatch storefront seems like the bow of a ship setting sail in an ocean of advertising,  Wish the sky weren''t quite so bright.  I might crop the lamp on the right out.', '2003-11-21 11:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(491763, 47407, 7628, '<td valign="top">you FOUND one? What is this - I feel there is irony here that I''m missing,  Is it perhaps part of a car engine?  I like the b&amp;w, perhaps colors wold detract from the simple composition.</td>', 'you FOUND one? What is this - I feel there is irony here that I''m missing,  Is it perhaps part of a car engine?  I like the b&w, perhaps colors wold detract from the simple composition.', '2003-11-21 11:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(491764, 47160, 7628, '<td valign="top">Yes, a good comment on what America is all about.  Wish the light dint; glare off the letters on the right.</td>', 'Yes, a good comment on what America is all about.  Wish the light dint; glare off the letters on the right.', '2003-11-21 11:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(491766, 47324, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like your use of DOF - you can see that body just well enough to knoew that you want what is in the bottle.  Wish his elbow were included.  Perhaps a bit more contrast would make it  more dramatic.</td>', 'I like your use of DOF - you can see that body just well enough to knoew that you want what is in the bottle.  Wish his elbow were included.  Perhaps a bit more contrast would make it  more dramatic.', '2003-11-21 11:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(491768, 47541, 2792, '<td valign="top">Love the red tone!</td>', 'Love the red tone!', '2003-11-21 11:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(491771, 46917, 7628, '<td valign="top">A light in the darkness.  here here!  I''ll vote for you for President!  You got that black realy black, and some nice detail of the workings of the bulb (very scientific) but there is some dust on the bulb that is distracting and there is a funny ribbon of glare to the left of the bulb.  I''d like that light in the darkness to be very clear and simple. Would be starker symbolism without the 230v and LEUCI being visible - could you angle the bulb down a bit more to get that out of the picture?</td>', 'A light in the darkness.  here here!  I''ll vote for you for President!  You got that black realy black, and some nice detail of the workings of the bulb (very scientific) but there is some dust on the bulb that is distracting and there is a funny ribbon of glare to the left of the bulb.  I''d like that light in the darkness to be very clear and simple. Would be starker symbolism without the 230v and LEUCI being visible - could you angle the bulb down a bit more to get that out of the picture?', '2003-11-21 11:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(491772, 47598, 2792, '<td valign="top">Disturbing.</td>', 'Disturbing.', '2003-11-21 11:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(491774, 47266, 2792, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  Very nicely composed.  Love how the crow appears to be looking at the distruction.  The only thing that I don''t like is that it seems a little bit oversharpened.  Still, nice job.  Fits the challenge nicely.</td>', 'Great concept!  Very nicely composed.  Love how the crow appears to be looking at the distruction.  The only thing that I don''t like is that it seems a little bit oversharpened.  Still, nice job.  Fits the challenge nicely.', '2003-11-21 11:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(491776, 47208, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice rays of light, good idea.  I''d crop the bottom, it would glamorize the church better, that weedy lot is abit depressing (or did yo mean it to be ironic?  then include more of the lot)  Church is a bit dark - would be hard to adjust without ruining the sky - maybe some sp[ot editing after the challenge?</td>', 'Nice rays of light, good idea.  I''d crop the bottom, it would glamorize the church better, that weedy lot is abit depressing (or did yo mean it to be ironic?  then include more of the lot)  Church is a bit dark - would be hard to adjust without ruining the sky - maybe some sp[ot editing after the challenge?', '2003-11-21 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(491777, 47703, 7628, '<td valign="top">Stark composition, makes it impossible to ignore.  Wish there weren;t glare off the jar top, and reflections in the jar.  Seems to tilt a bit to the right.  Nice deatil in the fish (?)</td>', 'Stark composition, makes it impossible to ignore.  Wish there weren;t glare off the jar top, and reflections in the jar.  Seems to tilt a bit to the right.  Nice deatil in the fish (?)', '2003-11-21 11:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
