(491780, 46730, 7628, '<td valign="top">The blurred fists are very effective. I like how they are captured against the black sky. Wish the faces were sharper.  Colors could use some adjustment - the light feels too warm for a cold night.</td>', 'The blurred fists are very effective. I like how they are captured against the black sky. Wish the faces were sharper.  Colors could use some adjustment - the light feels too warm for a cold night.', '2003-11-21 11:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
