(491783, 47523, 7628, '<td valign="top">true.  How would a black background work, with a spot of light on the fist or face - would make the situation seem grimmer.</td>', 'true.  How would a black background work, with a spot of light on the fist or face - would make the situation seem grimmer.', '2003-11-21 11:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
