(491785, 46848, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like you the rest of the deck is splayed out beneath - gives some 3d interest.  But what are you saying about this most wanted card?  It is a picture of it, but it doesn;t tell us what to think.</td>', 'I like you the rest of the deck is splayed out beneath - gives some 3d interest.  But what are you saying about this most wanted card?  It is a picture of it, but it doesn;t tell us what to think.', '2003-11-21 11:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
