(491788, 47694, 7628, '<td valign="top">Worshiping at the machine of sugar and cafffine?  Funny.I wish you had gotten better resolution - better light.  The graininess and the blurr don;t add to this for me.</td>', 'Worshiping at the machine of sugar and cafffine?  Funny.I wish you had gotten better resolution - better light.  The graininess and the blurr don;t add to this for me.', '2003-11-21 11:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(491790, 47443, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice clean angles and colors, gives it a very artificial look which goes well with the theme.  Some of the brigh spots are too bright.  I''d crop in a bit more make it feel more abstract and unfriendly.</td>', 'nice clean angles and colors, gives it a very artificial look which goes well with the theme.  Some of the brigh spots are too bright.  I''d crop in a bit more make it feel more abstract and unfriendly.', '2003-11-21 11:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(491791, 47729, 7628, '<td valign="top">looks like its walking on water.  odd cloth behind is distracting.</td>', 'looks like its walking on water.  odd cloth behind is distracting.', '2003-11-21 11:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(491793, 47708, 2792, '<td valign="top">I''m sure a few people won''t like the politics of this photo and vote you down for it, but that''s not what voting is about. A strong statement makes great propaganda!  And you''ve done a good job of showing it.  Only things I would have liked was to not have had the chin cut off.  Also I think a portrait might have been more effective.  8</td>', 'I''m sure a few people won''t like the politics of this photo and vote you down for it, but that''s not what voting is about. A strong statement makes great propaganda!  And you''ve done a good job of showing it.  Only things I would have liked was to not have had the chin cut off.  Also I think a portrait might have been more effective.  8', '2003-11-21 11:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(491795, 47596, 7628, '<td valign="top">Scary.  Nice comment of smoking, and the marketing of smoking.  I could go two ways with this - either strip away all of the familiar - the everyday clothes, the background - have the face leering out of the darkness with cigarette in hand -<br/>OR<br/>have this skeletal figure in a totallye everyday situation - sitting at the luinch table with friends offering a cigarette.</td>', 'Scary.  Nice comment of smoking, and the marketing of smoking.  I could go two ways with this - either strip away all of the familiar - the everyday clothes, the background - have the face leering out of the darkness with cigarette in hand -ORhave this skeletal figure in a totallye everyday situation - sitting at the luinch table with friends offering a cigarette.', '2003-11-21 11:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(491796, 46852, 7628, '<td valign="top">Yes a powerful, beautiful individual.  The cigarette however draws all the attention in the composition.  Is that what you''re trying to say all that a woman is or could be lost to a nasty habit?<br/></td>', 'Yes a powerful, beautiful individual.  The cigarette however draws all the attention in the composition.  Is that what you''re trying to say all that a woman is or could be lost to a nasty habit?', '2003-11-21 11:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(491797, 47692, 2792, '<td valign="top">...if you look at "the world is yours" economically speaking.  Would have used quarter. =)  Nice photo, good propaganda!</td>', '...if you look at "the world is yours" economically speaking.  Would have used quarter. =)  Nice photo, good propaganda!', '2003-11-21 11:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(491798, 46864, 2792, '<td valign="top">Clever photo!  I''m sure some people would say its too blurry, but it works.</td>', 'Clever photo!  I''m sure some people would say its too blurry, but it works.', '2003-11-21 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(491800, 47322, 7628, '<td valign="top">the word target in a bit unnerving.  The cross seems to be a jabbing finger, telling us what the rules are.  Stark and intimidating.  Perhaps more contrast would bring out that nice shadow.</td>', 'the word target in a bit unnerving.  The cross seems to be a jabbing finger, telling us what the rules are.  Stark and intimidating.  Perhaps more contrast would bring out that nice shadow.', '2003-11-21 11:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(491801, 47569, 2792, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I like the funky colors.</td>', 'Not sure if I like the funky colors.', '2003-11-21 11:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(491802, 47208, 2792, '<td valign="top">Needs a level boost.</td>', 'Needs a level boost.', '2003-11-21 11:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(491803, 47593, 7628, '<td valign="top">Well I know I don''t believe it until I see it up in lights!  LOL  Back ground above the sign is distracting - perhaps if you had taking the shot from below the sign you could have backed it with sky?</td>', 'Well I know I don''t believe it until I see it up in lights!  LOL  Back ground above the sign is distracting - perhaps if you had taking the shot from below the sign you could have backed it with sky?', '2003-11-21 11:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(491804, 47545, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - the simple two part background compliments the sculture, brings out colors inthe metal.  Makes him seem very grand to be looking up at him - the tree almost seeems like a cape flying out behind him.</td>', 'Nice composition - the simple two part background compliments the sculture, brings out colors inthe metal.  Makes him seem very grand to be looking up at him - the tree almost seeems like a cape flying out behind him.', '2003-11-21 11:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(491805, 47434, 2792, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing thought.  Looks like stairway to heaven, light at the end of the tunnel?</td>', 'Very disturbing thought.  Looks like stairway to heaven, light at the end of the tunnel?', '2003-11-21 11:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(491807, 47563, 2792, '<td valign="top">That makes me hungry, must be good propaganda. =P  Very nicely composed shot.  Only wish you used the maximum dimensions allowed.</td>', 'That makes me hungry, must be good propaganda. =P  Very nicely composed shot.  Only wish you used the maximum dimensions allowed.', '2003-11-21 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(491808, 47499, 7628, '<td valign="top">A dramatic moment - I crop down from the left - come in closer to tha man who is giving instructions and loose the folks without fur coats.  crop in a bit from the right to give the feeling that there are perhaps moe people lidtenning to him hiding the fact that the gray coated woman is the last one there.</td>', 'A dramatic moment - I crop down from the left - come in closer to tha man who is giving instructions and loose the folks without fur coats.  crop in a bit from the right to give the feeling that there are perhaps moe people lidtenning to him hiding the fact that the gray coated woman is the last one there.', '2003-11-21 11:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(491809, 47548, 7628, '<td valign="top">I...CAN''T...RESIST...MUST...CLICK....10...<br/>very funny and topical.  <br/>I think it would be more effective without the photo within the photo - that brown wood background is too blah.  I''d like to see more of the "real" hand on the mouse</td>', 'I...CAN''T...RESIST...MUST...CLICK....10...very funny and topical.  I think it would be more effective without the photo within the photo - that brown wood background is too blah.  I''d like to see more of the "real" hand on the mouse', '2003-11-21 12:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(491811, 47478, 2792, '<td valign="top">Wow, love the smoke!  Funny, love the title</td>', 'Wow, love the smoke!  Funny, love the title', '2003-11-21 12:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(491812, 47598, 7628, '<td valign="top">Scary.  Not exactly subtle, but then neither are guns.  Wish you could have composed the meaning into the picture rather than having to right the note.</td>', 'Scary.  Not exactly subtle, but then neither are guns.  Wish you could have composed the meaning into the picture rather than having to right the note.', '2003-11-21 12:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(491813, 47410, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wow.  What a stunt.  And you''ve captured it well.  Sharp, nice against the blue.  It feels a bit cut short at the bottom - could you have included more of the jet trail? 8</td>', 'Wow.  What a stunt.  And you''ve captured it well.  Sharp, nice against the blue.  It feels a bit cut short at the bottom - could you have included more of the jet trail? 8', '2003-11-21 12:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(491814, 47478, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice effect to have the skull smoking as well and the cigarette.  Post this around town!  Well lit, nice focus.  I might crop a bit more off the bottom left - make the cigareetes go right to the corner, the ash tray is in an odd position , and doesn;t really finish the corner. 8</td>', 'Nice effect to have the skull smoking as well and the cigarette.  Post this around town!  Well lit, nice focus.  I might crop a bit more off the bottom left - make the cigareetes go right to the corner, the ash tray is in an odd position , and doesn;t really finish the corner. 8', '2003-11-21 12:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(491815, 47504, 7628, '<td valign="top">Ah, mindless patriotism.  Nice meaning, nicelighting - the light on the blank faces and on the flat of the hands as they point to the corner (nice composition too)  Would have looked cool with a long line of these "patriots" fading into the background with a shallow DOF - with just two of them I think it would be better if both were sharp. I like this very much. 8</td>', 'Ah, mindless patriotism.  Nice meaning, nicelighting - the light on the blank faces and on the flat of the hands as they point to the corner (nice composition too)  Would have looked cool with a long line of these "patriots" fading into the background with a shallow DOF - with just two of them I think it would be better if both were sharp. I like this very much. 8', '2003-11-21 12:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(491817, 47723, 7628, '<td valign="top">Here here!  Very nice simple composition.  Darws aur attention to the book and the expression on the girl''s face.  That wonderful comunion between reader and book.  Very nice.  I wish the whole background were black - not with the material on the right.  still very nice!  7</td>', 'Here here!  Very nice simple composition.  Darws aur attention to the book and the expression on the girl''s face.  That wonderful comunion between reader and book.  Very nice.  I wish the whole background were black - not with the material on the right.  still very nice!  7', '2003-11-21 12:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(491820, 47291, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like this - same as the other one using woden models - the mindless patriotism.  I like the sharp silouette,and I''m intrigued by the multiple flag effect - how does that work?  The meaning in great - overblown image, with little substance and now thought to meaning.  Nice composition - the balance to the blue field and the dark figuresm the diagonal of the stripes . may favorite of those I''ve seen. 10</td>', 'I like this - same as the other one using woden models - the mindless patriotism.  I like the sharp silouette,and I''m intrigued by the multiple flag effect - how does that work?  The meaning in great - overblown image, with little substance and now thought to meaning.  Nice composition - the balance to the blue field and the dark figuresm the diagonal of the stripes . may favorite of those I''ve seen. 10', '2003-11-21 12:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(491828, 47223, 6504, '<td valign="top">If this is reality based, get away from that person and never look back!!!  Abuse is a progressive disease.  It gets worse not better.<br/>As for the photo, it is appropriately out of focus and dark.</td>', 'If this is reality based, get away from that person and never look back!!!  Abuse is a progressive disease.  It gets worse not better.As for the photo, it is appropriately out of focus and dark.', '2003-11-21 12:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
