(491843, 47410, 3102, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  I would have liked a little more breathing room at the bottom, personally, but it''s definitely among my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Awesome shot!  I would have liked a little more breathing room at the bottom, personally, but it''s definitely among my favorites of the challenge.', '2003-11-21 13:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(491854, 47478, 12268, '<td valign="top">This is just a great shot! I love the way the skull looks like it is smoking. The grossness of the ashtray &amp; all the filled butts really adds to the effect &amp; is complimented well with the title. THe lighting &amp; composition is of course excellent! Great shot!</td>', 'This is just a great shot! I love the way the skull looks like it is smoking. The grossness of the ashtray & all the filled butts really adds to the effect & is complimented well with the title. THe lighting & composition is of course excellent! Great shot!', '2003-11-21 13:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(491856, 47708, 12268, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot. I love that you ised duct tape since all the hoopla about buying to tape up your windows and such. I had a friend that went broke buying the stuff &amp; didnt even know what to do with it. The message is strong here and so relevent to what is going on and considered patriotic these days. I like the composition as well.<br/></td>', 'This is a really nice shot. I love that you ised duct tape since all the hoopla about buying to tape up your windows and such. I had a friend that went broke buying the stuff & didnt even know what to do with it. The message is strong here and so relevent to what is going on and considered patriotic these days. I like the composition as well.', '2003-11-21 13:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
