(492034, 47433, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Very clear with good composition. There is just a hint of propaganda here and if I stretch my mind far enough I can see it. So I vote a 10.</td>', 'Wonderful image. Very clear with good composition. There is just a hint of propaganda here and if I stretch my mind far enough I can see it. So I vote a 10.', '2003-11-21 19:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(492036, 47694, 11769, '<td valign="top">They all look hooked to me. Could have been a better photo but I think I get your meaning.</td>', 'They all look hooked to me. Could have been a better photo but I think I get your meaning.', '2003-11-21 19:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(492039, 47535, 11769, '<td valign="top">I like how you incorporated the words into the image. It works better that way then as a Title. Clear clean and to the point. Hope you score high.</td>', 'I like how you incorporated the words into the image. It works better that way then as a Title. Clear clean and to the point. Hope you score high.', '2003-11-21 19:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(492083, 46852, 4493, '<td valign="top">This image actually has a real cool retro feel to it. Reminds me of b/w photography my father use to do. My biggest suggestion would be to lessen the negative space at the top and do this image in portrait orientation. 7 -danny</td>', 'This image actually has a real cool retro feel to it. Reminds me of b/w photography my father use to do. My biggest suggestion would be to lessen the negative space at the top and do this image in portrait orientation. 7 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(492084, 47400, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice crop and layout. The overall lighting is lacking in this shot. You may need multiple lights and a light box around the jewels. There is a how to under the Learn link of someone who photo''d a watch, and they show step by step how they set up the lighting to get the best results. 5 -danny</td>', 'Nice crop and layout. The overall lighting is lacking in this shot. You may need multiple lights and a light box around the jewels. There is a how to under the Learn link of someone who photo''d a watch, and they show step by step how they set up the lighting to get the best results. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(492085, 47465, 4493, '<td valign="top">Your image is 489 pixels on the long side. When you save the image, save it at 72 dpi and 640 pixel on the long side. This will give us a better view of your details. The image overall is powerful in it''s statement. Good lighting and composition. I wouldn''t mind seeing more of the hand. 8 -danny</td>', 'Your image is 489 pixels on the long side. When you save the image, save it at 72 dpi and 640 pixel on the long side. This will give us a better view of your details. The image overall is powerful in it''s statement. Good lighting and composition. I wouldn''t mind seeing more of the hand. 8 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(492086, 47602, 4493, '<td valign="top">Overall not bad. The inverted colors actually makes for a more interesting composition. 6 -danny</td>', 'Overall not bad. The inverted colors actually makes for a more interesting composition. 6 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(492087, 47529, 4493, '<td valign="top">I think that a slight sharpen after resize would bring life back into these fish. :-)<br/>Seriously, when you resize down you need to do a light sharpen afterwards to get your crispness back. 5 -danny</td>', 'I think that a slight sharpen after resize would bring life back into these fish. :-)Seriously, when you resize down you need to do a light sharpen afterwards to get your crispness back. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(492088, 46824, 4493, '<td valign="top">With the portrait orientation of the magazine, a portrait mode in your shot would be compositionally more pleasing. You also shot under tungsten lighting with your white balance not adjusted for it. This leaves a yellow cast to your shot. 5 -danny</td>', 'With the portrait orientation of the magazine, a portrait mode in your shot would be compositionally more pleasing. You also shot under tungsten lighting with your white balance not adjusted for it. This leaves a yellow cast to your shot. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(492089, 47474, 4493, '<td valign="top">I DO!<br/> <br/>Did you try a portrait orientation for this shot? or a square crop to loose most of the right brighter part of the image. 6 -danny</td>', 'I DO! Did you try a portrait orientation for this shot? or a square crop to loose most of the right brighter part of the image. 6 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(492090, 47223, 4493, '<td valign="top">Hrm... I can see a statement of you meaning to have the soft focus and underexposed shot, but to me it makes the image seem more of a snap shot than a planned shot. Did you try a black and white conversion with higher contrast? This might have given you more of an artistic interpretation. 5 -danny</td>', 'Hrm... I can see a statement of you meaning to have the soft focus and underexposed shot, but to me it makes the image seem more of a snap shot than a planned shot. Did you try a black and white conversion with higher contrast? This might have given you more of an artistic interpretation. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(492091, 47415, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not sure the capabilities of your camera, but did you try a portrait mode view looking at the underside of both feet, shallowish DOF and the beer bottles and keys on the bed in the foreground? Something that would look more like an ad compain and not a hodge podge of ideas. 5 -danny</td>', 'Not sure the capabilities of your camera, but did you try a portrait mode view looking at the underside of both feet, shallowish DOF and the beer bottles and keys on the bed in the foreground? Something that would look more like an ad compain and not a hodge podge of ideas. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(492092, 46722, 4493, '<td valign="top">That''s what a chinchilla looks like? Cute lil buggar! I''m sure it was difficult to get the guy to stay still long enough for the shot, but your overall focus even on the monitor is soft. To get the ''ad'' feel you''re wanting, you need a tact sharp focus. A sharpening in your editing software after resize will help some. 5 -danny</td>', 'That''s what a chinchilla looks like? Cute lil buggar! I''m sure it was difficult to get the guy to stay still long enough for the shot, but your overall focus even on the monitor is soft. To get the ''ad'' feel you''re wanting, you need a tact sharp focus. A sharpening in your editing software after resize will help some. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(492093, 47418, 4493, '<td valign="top">On board flash, red eye, dead center composition, title not really showing propaganda. I''m sure they''re having fun, but this image doesn''t seem to fit into this challenge. 4 -danny</td>', 'On board flash, red eye, dead center composition, title not really showing propaganda. I''m sure they''re having fun, but this image doesn''t seem to fit into this challenge. 4 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(492094, 47598, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry for the loss. I think that a more dramatic view of the gun and just part of the torn image may have made a stronger impact to the viewers. Sometimes in photography less is more. 5 -danny</td>', 'I''m sorry for the loss. I think that a more dramatic view of the gun and just part of the torn image may have made a stronger impact to the viewers. Sometimes in photography less is more. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(492095, 47594, 4493, '<td valign="top">Hrm, lunchtime walk, look down, snap some sidewalk flowers, put a title, upload. The color saturation of the red ones is oversaturated. The composition is lacking in artistic creativity. Did you try a square crop on just the middle part of the image? Did you take photo''s of them at different angles? Did you try other angles to try and bring out the beauty of these ''Flowers Forever''? 4 -danny</td>', 'Hrm, lunchtime walk, look down, snap some sidewalk flowers, put a title, upload. The color saturation of the red ones is oversaturated. The composition is lacking in artistic creativity. Did you try a square crop on just the middle part of the image? Did you take photo''s of them at different angles? Did you try other angles to try and bring out the beauty of these ''Flowers Forever''? 4 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(492096, 47544, 4493, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just love room light and shallow depth of field. It can make almost any object stand out from its surroundings. I also feel that the center composition works well here. 7 -danny</td>', 'Don''t you just love room light and shallow depth of field. It can make almost any object stand out from its surroundings. I also feel that the center composition works well here. 7 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(492098, 46906, 4493, '<td valign="top">Looks like a color version of the other eagle. I think camera limitations are going to make this unappealing to the voters. Nothing against your shot, just limits of the camera. I think with the amount of noise in the shot, that a straight black and white conversion and square crop would have made a stronger shot. 5 -danny</td>', 'Looks like a color version of the other eagle. I think camera limitations are going to make this unappealing to the voters. Nothing against your shot, just limits of the camera. I think with the amount of noise in the shot, that a straight black and white conversion and square crop would have made a stronger shot. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(492099, 47611, 14043, '<td valign="top">It took me awhile to figure out that those were CDs in the background.  They were so shiny I thought that they were a ribbon or something, probably because the award is so dominate that it draws your eye directly to it, and I hadn''t yet looked at it for more than a few seconds (I know how stupid that sounds...but it''s true).  <br/> <br/>Your title seems um..."trendy" with the wording you used, but your picture seems very classic because of the award and sheet music.  Perhaps you could try to harmonize them a bit more next time, that threw me off as well.  I like the reflections from the CDs though, adds some nice light.</td>', 'It took me awhile to figure out that those were CDs in the background.  They were so shiny I thought that they were a ribbon or something, probably because the award is so dominate that it draws your eye directly to it, and I hadn''t yet looked at it for more than a few seconds (I know how stupid that sounds...but it''s true).   Your title seems um..."trendy" with the wording you used, but your picture seems very classic because of the award and sheet music.  Perhaps you could try to harmonize them a bit more next time, that threw me off as well.  I like the reflections from the CDs though, adds some nice light.', '2003-11-21 22:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(492100, 46835, 4493, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good idea and composition, what got you here is the colors. What was the reason for changing your hues? Where''d the pink come from? You could have boosted the red and blue without introducing the pink and the shot would have been stronger in my opinion. 5 -danny</td>', 'I think this is a good idea and composition, what got you here is the colors. What was the reason for changing your hues? Where''d the pink come from? You could have boosted the red and blue without introducing the pink and the shot would have been stronger in my opinion. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(492101, 47603, 4493, '<td valign="top">Don''t you wish you could use the dodge tool and lighten the left side of that bag some? That and a crop to exclude most of the left wall would make for a better composition. The left wall doesn''t add anything to the presentation, it just pulls the eye away from the subject on the bag. 6 -danny</td>', 'Don''t you wish you could use the dodge tool and lighten the left side of that bag some? That and a crop to exclude most of the left wall would make for a better composition. The left wall doesn''t add anything to the presentation, it just pulls the eye away from the subject on the bag. 6 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(492103, 47208, 4493, '<td valign="top">Sometimes even a great beam of light doesn''t make a shot. The church with the house next to it and the white in front of it seem to actually bring the shot down instead of lift it up. I''m sure it''s a nice church and all, but the muted tones and composition seem off balanced and flat. 5 -danny</td>', 'Sometimes even a great beam of light doesn''t make a shot. The church with the house next to it and the white in front of it seem to actually bring the shot down instead of lift it up. I''m sure it''s a nice church and all, but the muted tones and composition seem off balanced and flat. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(492104, 47384, 4493, '<td valign="top">Excellent representation of the topic. I like this. I wouldn''t mind a second light source to lessen the hard shadows on the right. 7 -danny</td>', 'Excellent representation of the topic. I like this. I wouldn''t mind a second light source to lessen the hard shadows on the right. 7 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(492105, 47726, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. Where''s your light source? Underneath? I think your focus may be a little soft, but overall well done and nice to look at. 7 -danny</td>', 'Good lighting. Where''s your light source? Underneath? I think your focus may be a little soft, but overall well done and nice to look at. 7 -danny', '2003-11-21 22:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(492107, 47449, 4493, '<td valign="top">At first I was going to recommend a crop to exclude the people on the right, then realized without them, you''d just have a cop with a clown nose. How goofy would that look? You could crop a little off from the left to remove those people though :-)<br/> <br/>Decent candid shot. 5 -danny</td>', 'At first I was going to recommend a crop to exclude the people on the right, then realized without them, you''d just have a cop with a clown nose. How goofy would that look? You could crop a little off from the left to remove those people though :-) Decent candid shot. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(492108, 47545, 4493, '<td valign="top">Portrait mode would really help you here. Also, stand back some so your perspective isn''t so skewed. Nice blue sky. 5 -danny</td>', 'Portrait mode would really help you here. Also, stand back some so your perspective isn''t so skewed. Nice blue sky. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(492111, 47494, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. White balance is a biggie here. Your yellow cast is a result of tungsten lighting. Most cameras allow for a white balance to correct that. Also, a second fill light on the right to even out some of the hard shadows would give you a more finished look. 6 -danny</td>', 'Nice concept. White balance is a biggie here. Your yellow cast is a result of tungsten lighting. Most cameras allow for a white balance to correct that. Also, a second fill light on the right to even out some of the hard shadows would give you a more finished look. 6 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(492114, 47692, 4493, '<td valign="top">Here is a case of an excellent photo that is put into a challenge with a title hoping to make it fit. As far as this shot technically, it''s near perfect... however, I have a hard time giving a score without taking into concideration that we are trying to meet a challenge subject here. If you followed the thread I posted in on the forums, my opinion is quite clear there. 7 -danny</td>', 'Here is a case of an excellent photo that is put into a challenge with a title hoping to make it fit. As far as this shot technically, it''s near perfect... however, I have a hard time giving a score without taking into concideration that we are trying to meet a challenge subject here. If you followed the thread I posted in on the forums, my opinion is quite clear there. 7 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(492116, 47702, 4493, '<td valign="top">I remember all this... and had to update all the PC''s at my work... what a pain. I''m glad you included the flash light here, it makes the image complete. 8 -danny</td>', 'I remember all this... and had to update all the PC''s at my work... what a pain. I''m glad you included the flash light here, it makes the image complete. 8 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(492118, 47432, 4493, '<td valign="top">It''s unique. I see what you''re going for here, to bad the DPC rules prevent you from getting the true x-ray feel you''re wanting. 5 -danny</td>', 'It''s unique. I see what you''re going for here, to bad the DPC rules prevent you from getting the true x-ray feel you''re wanting. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(492121, 46860, 4493, '<td valign="top">Square crop to loose the light on the left. 5 -danny</td>', 'Square crop to loose the light on the left. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(492123, 46831, 4493, '<td valign="top">I know you wanted to include all the branches of the right tree, but by doing so you have an unbalanced amount of space behind the church. There would be nothing wrong with cropping some of the branches off so that the image isn''t heavy on the left. Great colors and lighting. 8 -danny</td>', 'I know you wanted to include all the branches of the right tree, but by doing so you have an unbalanced amount of space behind the church. There would be nothing wrong with cropping some of the branches off so that the image isn''t heavy on the left. Great colors and lighting. 8 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(492125, 47708, 4493, '<td valign="top">1002 uses for duct tape. It does seem that the rest of the world is tired of hearing us defend our freedom. Good interpretation of the challenge topic. 6 -danny</td>', '1002 uses for duct tape. It does seem that the rest of the world is tired of hearing us defend our freedom. Good interpretation of the challenge topic. 6 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(492126, 47590, 4493, '<td valign="top">Pleasing composition. I think the white pawn may be just a little too centered, but not overly. Good use of depth of field to draw the viewer to your main subject. 6 -danny</td>', 'Pleasing composition. I think the white pawn may be just a little too centered, but not overly. Good use of depth of field to draw the viewer to your main subject. 6 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(492127, 47335, 4493, '<td valign="top">Message is good. I think your angle may be too much. Reading the concrete building is difficult. Did you move some to the left and try a shot from there? 5 -danny</td>', 'Message is good. I think your angle may be too much. Reading the concrete building is difficult. Did you move some to the left and try a shot from there? 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(492130, 47707, 4493, '<td valign="top">Fill flash. This image is underexposed in the front due to back lighting. Using the flash during the day can help get rid of dark shadows when your subject has such hard back lighting. That and the dodge tool would bring new life to this image. 5 -danny</td>', 'Fill flash. This image is underexposed in the front due to back lighting. Using the flash during the day can help get rid of dark shadows when your subject has such hard back lighting. That and the dodge tool would bring new life to this image. 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(492132, 46730, 4493, '<td valign="top">Rebellion or fans at a football game? Any picket signs in the crowd? 5 -danny</td>', 'Rebellion or fans at a football game? Any picket signs in the crowd? 5 -danny', '2003-11-21 23:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(492140, 47478, 13728, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!! My favoirte in this group for sure.  Only did you have to smoke all those cigarettes...yuk, maybe they were propls only!!  But then all that second hand smoke!!  Very powerful and good jot.  Meets the challenge will in my opinion</td>', 'Excellent shot!! My favoirte in this group for sure.  Only did you have to smoke all those cigarettes...yuk, maybe they were propls only!!  But then all that second hand smoke!!  Very powerful and good jot.  Meets the challenge will in my opinion', '2003-11-21 23:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(492142, 47434, 13728, '<td valign="top">Very powerful shot.  I like the way she is looking and the way the top of the steps is overexposed.  It works well here</td>', 'Very powerful shot.  I like the way she is looking and the way the top of the steps is overexposed.  It works well here', '2003-11-21 23:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(492143, 46730, 13728, '<td valign="top">Very nnice shot. Love he blurriness of the hands.  Well done</td>', 'Very nnice shot. Love he blurriness of the hands.  Well done', '2003-11-21 23:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(492146, 47466, 13728, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot technically, although I am not sure about the propaganda part</td>', 'Very nice shot technically, although I am not sure about the propaganda part', '2003-11-21 23:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(492147, 47705, 13728, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Great lighting and I really like the way te microphone is really clear and the speaker out of focus.  One of the few pictures in this chalenge, that actually meets the criteria of the chalenge</td>', 'Well done.  Great lighting and I really like the way te microphone is really clear and the speaker out of focus.  One of the few pictures in this chalenge, that actually meets the criteria of the chalenge', '2003-11-21 23:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(492151, 47540, 13728, '<td valign="top">Powerful.  By were this picture appears to be taken, it looks like you were in the middle of your very own propganda challenge this week.  Hope you are safe!</td>', 'Powerful.  By were this picture appears to be taken, it looks like you were in the middle of your very own propganda challenge this week.  Hope you are safe!', '2003-11-21 23:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(492152, 47324, 13728, '<td valign="top">Nice treatment of the challenge.  I like how you have chosen your focus points</td>', 'Nice treatment of the challenge.  I like how you have chosen your focus points', '2003-11-21 23:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(492155, 47184, 13728, '<td valign="top">An amusing approach to the challenge. Nice photo also</td>', 'An amusing approach to the challenge. Nice photo also', '2003-11-21 23:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(492157, 47418, 13728, '<td valign="top">This is a nice snapshot of friends having  a good time, but I am not sure where the propaganda part fits in</td>', 'This is a nice snapshot of friends having  a good time, but I am not sure where the propaganda part fits in', '2003-11-21 23:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(492160, 47522, 13728, '<td valign="top">This is a nice landscape, although is is a bit overexposed in the sky and top of the picture, but I dont get the propaganda part</td>', 'This is a nice landscape, although is is a bit overexposed in the sky and top of the picture, but I dont get the propaganda part', '2003-11-21 23:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(492164, 46819, 13728, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and approach, I like your title also</td>', 'Interesting angle and approach, I like your title also', '2003-11-21 23:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(492165, 47499, 13728, '<td valign="top">Very nice photojournalistic approach to the chaenge.  One of the few pictures I have looked at that really seems to meet the challenge</td>', 'Very nice photojournalistic approach to the chaenge.  One of the few pictures I have looked at that really seems to meet the challenge', '2003-11-21 23:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(492184, 47434, 7733, '<td valign="top">Is this easy? very good!</td>', 'Is this easy? very good!', '2003-11-22 01:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(492185, 47717, 6477, '<td valign="top">As I love and protect dogs, I consider this message a very important one. Technically I like the light in the shot and of course, the model!</td>', 'As I love and protect dogs, I consider this message a very important one. Technically I like the light in the shot and of course, the model!', '2003-11-22 01:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(492201, 47478, 2567, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot.  Focus, color and composition is perfect.  10</td>', 'Terrific shot.  Focus, color and composition is perfect.  10', '2003-11-22 03:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(492209, 47563, 4008, '<td valign="top">Not sure it is propaganda, but it is sure a nice advertising shot. I like the pasta leading the eye into the shot, the balance of red tones composed throught the image, contrasted by the white ingredients. The black at the back is a bit to strong in my opinion, a nice brown tint would have complemented the image better I think. And the bottle should not have been cut at the top. Or maybe getting closer, leaving out more of the black (and cutting of more of the bottle, glass etc.) could have solved it.</td>', 'Not sure it is propaganda, but it is sure a nice advertising shot. I like the pasta leading the eye into the shot, the balance of red tones composed throught the image, contrasted by the white ingredients. The black at the back is a bit to strong in my opinion, a nice brown tint would have complemented the image better I think. And the bottle should not have been cut at the top. Or maybe getting closer, leaving out more of the black (and cutting of more of the bottle, glass etc.) could have solved it.', '2003-11-22 05:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(492210, 47322, 4008, '<td valign="top">I think a spotlight (for example with a torchlight) on the Jesus figure would have made this image much stronger, more complete.</td>', 'I think a spotlight (for example with a torchlight) on the Jesus figure would have made this image much stronger, more complete.', '2003-11-22 05:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(492214, 47526, 4008, '<td valign="top">great expression and outfit and good variation on know image. Skin tone looks a bit too green to me. One of the top images in this challenge.</td>', 'great expression and outfit and good variation on know image. Skin tone looks a bit too green to me. One of the top images in this challenge.', '2003-11-22 05:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(492215, 47478, 4008, '<td valign="top">The propaganda is in the title, not in the image. The image tells the real story. A great image which could be used as a poster straight away, no improvements needed. I especially like the smoke coming out of the skull. 9</td>', 'The propaganda is in the title, not in the image. The image tells the real story. A great image which could be used as a poster straight away, no improvements needed. I especially like the smoke coming out of the skull. 9', '2003-11-22 05:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(492216, 47489, 4008, '<td valign="top">funny twist on the theme and lovely image.</td>', 'funny twist on the theme and lovely image.', '2003-11-22 05:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(492218, 47708, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might not have cropped so tight, and would like to have a little sharper focus.</td>', 'I might not have cropped so tight, and would like to have a little sharper focus.', '2003-11-22 06:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
