(492489, 47610, 12151, '<td valign="top">The image is ok, but I really wouldn''t know what it meant at all without the explicit title.  That''s why I''ve marked you down... I''m looking for more message in the image itself.</td>', 'The image is ok, but I really wouldn''t know what it meant at all without the explicit title.  That''s why I''ve marked you down... I''m looking for more message in the image itself.', '2003-11-22 23:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(492492, 47466, 12151, '<td valign="top">One of my top scores of the week, because: 1) You actually know what propaganda is. 2) You made an interesting image. 3) Your image can stand alone without exposition in the title!!!  So really, you''re one of only a handful who didn''t really irk me...</td>', 'One of my top scores of the week, because: 1) You actually know what propaganda is. 2) You made an interesting image. 3) Your image can stand alone without exposition in the title!!!  So really, you''re one of only a handful who didn''t really irk me...', '2003-11-23 00:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(492493, 46722, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very nice image of propaganda.  In terms of content, maybe you would''ve had a stronger effect if your background ad wasn''t from a computer monitor... the monitor kind of weakens the seriousness of the message (unless you wanted it to be quirky/humorous, but htne it loses some of its propaganda-flavor).</td>', 'Very nice image of propaganda.  In terms of content, maybe you would''ve had a stronger effect if your background ad wasn''t from a computer monitor... the monitor kind of weakens the seriousness of the message (unless you wanted it to be quirky/humorous, but htne it loses some of its propaganda-flavor).', '2003-11-23 00:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(492496, 47604, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very nice image of propaganda, and you''re one of only a few who''s images don''t use the title as a necessary crutch.  Good job!</td>', 'Very nice image of propaganda, and you''re one of only a few who''s images don''t use the title as a necessary crutch.  Good job!', '2003-11-23 00:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
