(492758, 47709, 12611, '<td valign="top">nice macro shot - wonderful colors. near perfect but the picture does not go all the way to conveying the message- that is- the love of money is the root of all evil- or "radix malorum est cupiditas." For this to be the theme- and be propoganda- you can''t show money alone.  You have exceeding photographic talent- this shot is 2 points from perfect- based only upon subject matter.</td>', 'nice macro shot - wonderful colors. near perfect but the picture does not go all the way to conveying the message- that is- the love of money is the root of all evil- or "radix malorum est cupiditas." For this to be the theme- and be propoganda- you can''t show money alone.  You have exceeding photographic talent- this shot is 2 points from perfect- based only upon subject matter.', '2003-11-23 15:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
