(494174, 47691, 12583, '<td valign="top">It was kind of hard to figure out what you were trying to convey here, but that might just be me. I apologize if everyone else got this and I didn''t. I know very personally how frustrating that can be! I would like to know what you were portraying though, if you do get a moment. Otherwise I''ll wait for details after the contest ends!</td>', 'It was kind of hard to figure out what you were trying to convey here, but that might just be me. I apologize if everyone else got this and I didn''t. I know very personally how frustrating that can be! I would like to know what you were portraying though, if you do get a moment. Otherwise I''ll wait for details after the contest ends!', '2003-11-24 23:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(494176, 47010, 4267, '<td valign="top">almost a stolen piece of art.. too much of the shot is someone elses work... the person should add more to the shot than just taking up space to meet the rules</td>', 'almost a stolen piece of art.. too much of the shot is someone elses work... the person should add more to the shot than just taking up space to meet the rules', '2003-11-24 23:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
