(494225, 47521, 9232, '<td valign="top">Creative use of negative space but the focus seems very soft.</td>', 'Creative use of negative space but the focus seems very soft.', '2003-11-25 01:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(494226, 46824, 9232, '<td valign="top">Colors seem to be shifted a little towards red (no white on the advertisement and the Canon logo seems a little red).</td>', 'Colors seem to be shifted a little towards red (no white on the advertisement and the Canon logo seems a little red).', '2003-11-25 01:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(494227, 47465, 14496, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo but i don''t understand the message.</td>', 'Beautiful photo but i don''t understand the message.', '2003-11-25 01:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(494229, 47324, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great use of shallow DOF.  Very good lighting.  If you don''t actually shoot product photos, you ought to after this challenge.  The only two little things I could even point out is a little side light from the right would have filled in and removed the shadow from in front of the jar (although you might want that shadow for depth) and the crop you selected cuts your BG model off at a joint; just a slightly wider crop would have left his elbow intact.</td>', 'Great use of shallow DOF.  Very good lighting.  If you don''t actually shoot product photos, you ought to after this challenge.  The only two little things I could even point out is a little side light from the right would have filled in and removed the shadow from in front of the jar (although you might want that shadow for depth) and the crop you selected cuts your BG model off at a joint; just a slightly wider crop would have left his elbow intact.', '2003-11-25 01:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(494230, 47692, 9232, '<td valign="top">I like the deep black on the righthand side of the image and I see your attempt to place the dime on a thirds intersection but somehow the continuous vertical darkness seems to offbalance the image a little.  Perhaps a crop with about half as much darkness on the righthand side or a crop that kept more of the model''s arm in the frame would yield a presentation that "feels" more balanced to me.  I''m not saying you failed at hitting your thirds intersection, just that somehow the intensity of the darkness gives me a feeling of a lack of balance.  Overall, this is a creative take on the subject and I continue to love the use of the posed models.  8</td>', 'I like the deep black on the righthand side of the image and I see your attempt to place the dime on a thirds intersection but somehow the continuous vertical darkness seems to offbalance the image a little.  Perhaps a crop with about half as much darkness on the righthand side or a crop that kept more of the model''s arm in the frame would yield a presentation that "feels" more balanced to me.  I''m not saying you failed at hitting your thirds intersection, just that somehow the intensity of the darkness gives me a feeling of a lack of balance.  Overall, this is a creative take on the subject and I continue to love the use of the posed models.  8', '2003-11-25 01:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(494232, 47504, 14496, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this solidarity FOR terrorism? Are they not supposed to be Nazis?</td>', 'Isn''t this solidarity FOR terrorism? Are they not supposed to be Nazis?', '2003-11-25 01:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(494233, 47410, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great subject, great perspective and impressive use of your border.  I would have liked to see a little more space at the bottom of the photo (although that may have yielded too much room to the contrails and they may have competed with the planes for attention).</td>', 'Great subject, great perspective and impressive use of your border.  I would have liked to see a little more space at the bottom of the photo (although that may have yielded too much room to the contrails and they may have competed with the planes for attention).', '2003-11-25 01:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(494234, 47563, 14496, '<td valign="top">This is a very attractive advertisement. I would eat at Tony''s.</td>', 'This is a very attractive advertisement. I would eat at Tony''s.', '2003-11-25 01:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(494237, 47499, 9232, '<td valign="top">I like this from a photojournalistic angle but some of the whites in the lower righthand third appear to be very hot.  The rest of the image looks to have solid color saturation and good depth (nice separation in the hair color of the individuals to the left of the green jacket).  Not sure much could have been done to limit the severity of the white areas.</td>', 'I like this from a photojournalistic angle but some of the whites in the lower righthand third appear to be very hot.  The rest of the image looks to have solid color saturation and good depth (nice separation in the hair color of the individuals to the left of the green jacket).  Not sure much could have been done to limit the severity of the white areas.', '2003-11-25 01:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(494240, 47711, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great composition; incredible color.  I don''t know that I see much correlation with Propaganda and the blue background seems to soften the focus on the edges of the cookies (it tends to blend in the shadows) but overall this is an impressive photo.</td>', 'Great composition; incredible color.  I don''t know that I see much correlation with Propaganda and the blue background seems to soften the focus on the edges of the cookies (it tends to blend in the shadows) but overall this is an impressive photo.', '2003-11-25 01:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(494241, 47540, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great subject and nice capture.  Sadly a little soft focus (what could you do, looks like you were in the middle of it).  9</td>', 'Great subject and nice capture.  Sadly a little soft focus (what could you do, looks like you were in the middle of it).  9', '2003-11-25 01:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(494242, 47465, 9232, '<td valign="top">I fail to understand the connection between the two philosophical/religious elements of the crucifix and the flag.  Was this a particular ceremony or was it staged?  If it was staged a little fill flash might have helped although the focus on the hand with a very shallow DOF is great effect.  I don''t like the drop shadow border selection especially with the single line border around the whole image.</td>', 'I fail to understand the connection between the two philosophical/religious elements of the crucifix and the flag.  Was this a particular ceremony or was it staged?  If it was staged a little fill flash might have helped although the focus on the hand with a very shallow DOF is great effect.  I don''t like the drop shadow border selection especially with the single line border around the whole image.', '2003-11-25 01:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(494243, 47724, 9232, '<td valign="top">I see a political or religious element within the photo (the star of David) and I like the technical merits of you photo but I don''t understand its statement.  Based solely on technical quality and presentation I score this moderately highly (7 although I''ll revisit that).  For presenting a clear message I find this intriguing.  Is this a statement of repression of the state of Israel?  If so, by whom?  A reference to western political pressure to deal with neighbors or perhaps a statement of the pressure imherent in constant suicide bombings.  The statement seems ambiguous but I am not voting on that, just commenting and wondering apart from the quality of your photo.</td>', 'I see a political or religious element within the photo (the star of David) and I like the technical merits of you photo but I don''t understand its statement.  Based solely on technical quality and presentation I score this moderately highly (7 although I''ll revisit that).  For presenting a clear message I find this intriguing.  Is this a statement of repression of the state of Israel?  If so, by whom?  A reference to western political pressure to deal with neighbors or perhaps a statement of the pressure imherent in constant suicide bombings.  The statement seems ambiguous but I am not voting on that, just commenting and wondering apart from the quality of your photo.', '2003-11-25 01:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(494247, 47415, 11184, '<td valign="top">Ha..well the border may be a bit distracting, as well as those things behind the horizontal bottle, but it surely gets it point across.  Coulda used some blood and a severe burn mark or two though....just kidding.  Thank you for not doing that. Good shot.</td>', 'Ha..well the border may be a bit distracting, as well as those things behind the horizontal bottle, but it surely gets it point across.  Coulda used some blood and a severe burn mark or two though....just kidding.  Thank you for not doing that. Good shot.', '2003-11-25 02:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(494252, 47597, 11184, '<td valign="top">Thats a real neat idea for a piano shot!  Works well.  Almost coulda used this idea for the ''grace'' challenge a few weeks back.</td>', 'Thats a real neat idea for a piano shot!  Works well.  Almost coulda used this idea for the ''grace'' challenge a few weeks back.', '2003-11-25 02:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(494256, 47462, 11184, '<td valign="top">Wow, it took me a minute to see the ghosted image.  Pretty darn cool visually, but might have had more impact if the guy was crouching down and spraying or atleast holding a can.  The couching down might have also made him blend better with the grafitti character as well, since they kinda crowd each other out like this.  I really do dig it though.</td>', 'Wow, it took me a minute to see the ghosted image.  Pretty darn cool visually, but might have had more impact if the guy was crouching down and spraying or atleast holding a can.  The couching down might have also made him blend better with the grafitti character as well, since they kinda crowd each other out like this.  I really do dig it though.', '2003-11-25 02:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(494260, 46819, 11184, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure you wanted a crowded look blocking out the sky given the title, but am wondering what it might have looked like if you got a little wider angle and let the curves play out a little more than overpowering them with the big dark one up front.   Pretty cool though.  Good idea and great title as well.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure you wanted a crowded look blocking out the sky given the title, but am wondering what it might have looked like if you got a little wider angle and let the curves play out a little more than overpowering them with the big dark one up front.   Pretty cool though.  Good idea and great title as well.', '2003-11-25 02:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(494263, 46864, 11184, '<td valign="top">I tried to take a shot like this of a White Castle late night several years back with a zoom lens out the car window in a bad neghborhood and almost got shot myself.</td>', 'I tried to take a shot like this of a White Castle late night several years back with a zoom lens out the car window in a bad neghborhood and almost got shot myself.', '2003-11-25 02:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
