(494364, 47692, 11241, '<td valign="top">really love the DOF you have on this shot...great job</td>', 'really love the DOF you have on this shot...great job', '2003-11-25 08:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(494386, 47616, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is an extremely powerful shot... great lighting, I love the DOF...  Personally I think something that could be improved is the lips... I fell that they are too dark red, and maybe you were going for that... but... I think lowering the red a bit might have helped as I am distracted from the needle by the lips... thats just my opinion though.  A very solid -9- Good Luck!</td>', 'This is an extremely powerful shot... great lighting, I love the DOF...  Personally I think something that could be improved is the lips... I fell that they are too dark red, and maybe you were going for that... but... I think lowering the red a bit might have helped as I am distracted from the needle by the lips... thats just my opinion though.  A very solid -9- Good Luck!', '2003-11-25 09:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(494388, 47248, 4967, '<td valign="top">One of the top POSTIVE messages for this challenge.  Excellent choice of black and white... very powerful!  I love the dof... the only thing I would have liked is a more solid black background...  The upper right seems to be a little crinkly.  Good lighting though and great job.  -9-</td>', 'One of the top POSTIVE messages for this challenge.  Excellent choice of black and white... very powerful!  I love the dof... the only thing I would have liked is a more solid black background...  The upper right seems to be a little crinkly.  Good lighting though and great job.  -9-', '2003-11-25 09:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(494391, 47478, 9735, '<td valign="top">Interesting ideas I like it a lot.</td>', 'Interesting ideas I like it a lot.', '2003-11-25 09:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(494396, 47522, 4967, '<td valign="top">On another day this might be magnificent... but on the day you shot this it''s extremely boring I''m sorry to say.  The flat, white sky, and the dull green and brown does absolutely nothing for me.  That added to the fact that this really has nothing to do with Propaganda that I can see makes this a -1- I''m sorry.  I would suggest trying a polarizer filter when you go out to try and enhance any colors that are there.</td>', 'On another day this might be magnificent... but on the day you shot this it''s extremely boring I''m sorry to say.  The flat, white sky, and the dull green and brown does absolutely nothing for me.  That added to the fact that this really has nothing to do with Propaganda that I can see makes this a -1- I''m sorry.  I would suggest trying a polarizer filter when you go out to try and enhance any colors that are there.', '2003-11-25 09:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(494399, 47418, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure why you entered this other then the fact you wanted to get a personal kid, snapshotty photo in the challenge. It''s definitely not propaganda.  I think that this kind of photo just makes voters not want to vote as much because it is a waste of time.  On that note, I want to try and help you improve your snapshots.  RED EYE!!!  If you are going to use flash, which it is obvious you did here... turn on the red eye reduction (it should be on almost any camera) This will cause multiple flashes of light before hand, to get the eyes ready for the real flash.  WATCH your background... The cluttered background here, and especially the pink shirt upper left takes your eyes away from your girls.  Nice job on the close crop though... I hope this helps... -1-</td>', 'I''m not really sure why you entered this other then the fact you wanted to get a personal kid, snapshotty photo in the challenge. It''s definitely not propaganda.  I think that this kind of photo just makes voters not want to vote as much because it is a waste of time.  On that note, I want to try and help you improve your snapshots.  RED EYE!!!  If you are going to use flash, which it is obvious you did here... turn on the red eye reduction (it should be on almost any camera) This will cause multiple flashes of light before hand, to get the eyes ready for the real flash.  WATCH your background... The cluttered background here, and especially the pink shirt upper left takes your eyes away from your girls.  Nice job on the close crop though... I hope this helps... -1-', '2003-11-25 09:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(494400, 47717, 9735, '<td valign="top">A great image. I can feel the sadness in his expression.</td>', 'A great image. I can feel the sadness in his expression.', '2003-11-25 09:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(494404, 47521, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m not really clear on what you were going for here... I think maybe you meant to put this in literalisms and not in propaganda?  I''m going to comment on it though, what I like, and what could be improved.  I like the uncluttered, plain, white background... it definitely adds to the photo.  I do not like your placing the main part almost perfectly centered... use your rule of thirds!  I would crop off a substantial amount of white from the top and the left, placing the subject in the upper left hand of the photo.  I like your use of texture in the bandaid, next to the smoothness of the scissors.  I''m bothered by the showing of the skin in the bottom right.  Hope you find these comments useful.</td>', 'I''m not really clear on what you were going for here... I think maybe you meant to put this in literalisms and not in propaganda?  I''m going to comment on it though, what I like, and what could be improved.  I like the uncluttered, plain, white background... it definitely adds to the photo.  I do not like your placing the main part almost perfectly centered... use your rule of thirds!  I would crop off a substantial amount of white from the top and the left, placing the subject in the upper left hand of the photo.  I like your use of texture in the bandaid, next to the smoothness of the scissors.  I''m bothered by the showing of the skin in the bottom right.  Hope you find these comments useful.', '2003-11-25 09:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
