(494553, 47293, 3936, '<td valign="top">The focus here looks a bit soft, and the setting sun is blown out at the right of the tower.  Also, the subject is dead center of the photo.  I''m not a rule of thirds hardliner, but it would have been helpful here.</td>', 'The focus here looks a bit soft, and the setting sun is blown out at the right of the tower.  Also, the subject is dead center of the photo.  I''m not a rule of thirds hardliner, but it would have been helpful here.', '2003-11-25 14:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
