(494618, 47272, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very good, and so timely. I think this would have been a bit better with out the handle with care,, while I think I understand your reason for including it, it does add one too many elements.<br/>I also might have had all the signs in black and white except for th fragile and background. That would have given a more conitinuous theme. 9</td>', 'Very good, and so timely. I think this would have been a bit better with out the handle with care,, while I think I understand your reason for including it, it does add one too many elements.I also might have had all the signs in black and white except for th fragile and background. That would have given a more conitinuous theme. 9', '2003-11-25 17:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
