(494832, 46722, 12583, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by muckpond:</b></div><hr/><i>the focus is too soft, i don''t know what you''re trying to say, and i don''t see how this fits the challenge.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yikes! I would have thought it was pretty obvious as to how this fits the challenge... and fairly obvious as to what I was trying to say! I do see that the focus is too soft and it isn''t quite "straight."<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-18 20:08:07.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by muckpond:the focus is too soft, i don''t know what you''re trying to say, and i don''t see how this fits the challenge.  Yikes! I would have thought it was pretty obvious as to how this fits the challenge... and fairly obvious as to what I was trying to say! I do see that the focus is too soft and it isn''t quite "straight."', '2003-11-26 00:10:48.000000', '2007-12-18 20:08:07.000000', 0),
