(525369, 47466, 14773, '<td valign="top">I can''t comprehend how anyone can score this photo a 1 or 2..or anything below a 5.  Photos aren''t entirely personal opinion, if you don''t like the subject matter, you still need to score points based on technical merit [I know, I''ve said that a hundred times].  The framing, lighting and texture are all great in this shot.</td>', 'I can''t comprehend how anyone can score this photo a 1 or 2..or anything below a 5.  Photos aren''t entirely personal opinion, if you don''t like the subject matter, you still need to score points based on technical merit [I know, I''ve said that a hundred times].  The framing, lighting and texture are all great in this shot.', '2003-12-29 11:30:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(537426, 47293, 8860, '<td valign="top">Zooming and panning slightly left would have made this composition. It would have placed Big Ben off-centre in the shot brought the interesting elements closer and would have excluded the irrelevant items such as the dark object in the foreground and some of the less interesting buildings on the right.<br/> <br/>Nice time of day and colour though, so it''s still a pleasing shot.</td>', 'Zooming and panning slightly left would have made this composition. It would have placed Big Ben off-centre in the shot brought the interesting elements closer and would have excluded the irrelevant items such as the dark object in the foreground and some of the less interesting buildings on the right. Nice time of day and colour though, so it''s still a pleasing shot.', '2004-01-09 13:45:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(539222, 47468, 14157, '<td valign="top">We went up to CLoudcroft one day and as we were heading home I saw this place and remebered the challenge! So I took the piccy. I love Cloudcroft in the winter...... ~sigh~<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-12 00:25:49.</i></td>', 'We went up to CLoudcroft one day and as we were heading home I saw this place and remebered the challenge! So I took the piccy. I love Cloudcroft in the winter...... ~sigh~', '2004-01-12 00:25:28.000000', '2004-01-12 00:25:49.000000', 0),
